<title>LATVIA: RTF, VALMIERA UP AT PRICE FIX.</title>
<headline>RTF, VALMIERA UP AT PRICE FIX.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvian shares registered the</p>
<p>following prices after the morning trade session on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Stocks were mixed while the Riga Transport Fleet and Riga</p>
<p>Shipyard maintained their recent gains.</p>
<p>RTF was up to 1.26 lats, adding two santimes and Unibanka</p>
<p>checked its recent slide by edging up one santime to 3.01 lats</p>
<p>but on a small volume.</p>
<p>Valmiera Glassfibre on the secondary list also rose to 1.42</p>
<p>form 1.40 lats amid prices in general mixed to lower.</p>
<p>Shares can be bought (B) or sold (S) at the following</p>
<p>prices and in the following volume, the bourse said in a</p>
<p>statement.</p>
